# shell: tracker
# work: home
# TS-052: the preference swaps type-to-select for type-to-filter, live.
# prefs: filter-on
wait 8
expect-rows 4
note with TypeAheadFiltering on, typing narrows the list to what matches
key a
key .
key t
wait 3
expect-rows 1
note Escape clears the terms but the preference keeps the mode engaged
key Escape
wait 3
expect-rows 4
key b
key .
key t
wait 3
expect-rows 1
note switching the preference off is observed live: the listing returns
write /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings TypeAheadFiltering off
wait 12
expect-rows 4
note and typing is type-to-select again, not a filter
key a
wait 3
expect-rows 4
expect-selected-name a.txt
quit
